---
title: "fullIntegrationLifecycle (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_create_user: createUser (POST /v1/integration/user)
    q_create_user --> q_get_token: generateToken (POST /v1/integration/token)
    q_get_token --> q_list_rounds: listActiveRounds (GET /v1/integration/rounds)
    q_list_rounds --> q_get_details: getRoundDetails (GET /v1/integration/rounds/id)
    q_get_details --> q_submit: submitApplication (POST /v1/integration/rounds/id/submit)
    q_submit --> q_get_sig: generateDepositSignature (GET /v1/integration/rounds/id/signature)
    q_get_sig --> q_approve_usdc: approve USDC transfer on-chain
    q_approve_usdc --> q_deposit: execute deposit with signature on-chain
    q_deposit --> q_webhook: webhook notification fired
    q_webhook --> q_review: application review (async, off-chain)
    q_review --> q_full_approve: full approval
    q_review --> q_partial_approve: partial approval
    q_review --> q_reject: rejection
    q_full_approve --> q_refund_period_a: 14-day MiCA refund period
    q_refund_period_a --> q_vest_a: vesting period
    q_vest_a --> [*]: claim tokens
    q_partial_approve --> q_excess_refund: claim excess USDC via contract
    q_excess_refund --> q_refund_period_p: 14-day MiCA refund period
    q_refund_period_p --> q_vest_p: vesting period
    q_vest_p --> [*]: claim tokens
    q_reject --> q_full_refund: claim full USDC refund via contract
    q_full_refund --> [*]: refund complete

    note right of q_get_token
        INV-001: JWT required for all subsequent API calls
    end note

    note right of q_deposit
        INV-002: deposit requires prior USDC approval and valid signature
        INV-003: webhook fires only on successful deposit
    end note

    note right of q_review
        INV-004: review yields exactly one outcome per application
        INV-005: MiCA 14-day refund applies to approved and partial outcomes
        INV-006: rejected users get immediate full refund
    end note
